// under way queues one (fwire_advise_run); the run takes the whole list, sorts it and merges ranges that touch or overlap (the pools of gmem_map's loop, the chunks of a large pool),
// asks for each merged range, and takes the list again until it is empty. One dispatch_async per add before, and one F_RDADVISE per buffer. Started at the first add, not at the
