    // The queue's references are released before g_res_commit_mu is let go and before g_res_done says the changes are done (never holding g_res_mu, so a dealloc's rh_wait /
    // res_remove keeps the g_res_commit_mu -> g_res_mu order): released after the unlock, a concurrent res_commit could return while this thread still held the last reference to
