//   reads at most once (its stamp is past the limit, so writes after it wait for the next submission's use). The replay runs behind the game: Ocarina's atlas writes for later
//   submissions each made a re-upload in the one being encoded. Outside a queue submission (presents, tests calling mtl_sub_begin) there is no limit and every use re-uploads as before.
