    // RESONANCE added and removed about 79,000 every 300 frames on an iPhone 15 Pro Max (0.8 ms of residency commits a frame; upstream issues #1061 and #2423). It has no sRGB / linear
    // twin and nothing to fill. Another thread may have shared one over the same storage meanwhile: then that one is used (upstream NXNative 0929dd69e, MIT, through our g_alias)
    if (t->d.target == NVN_TEXTURE_TARGET_BUFFER) {
