// Any compile that failed because the compiler service died (a plain pipeline, a host pipeline, a function specialization, a capture): the service took every compile it held
// down, the captures of the current periods among them, whether or not one of them reported it (upstream NXNative 9bd8bb386: Ocarina of Time, a second crash met only plain
// compute compiles, and the period then written, with 42 task / mesh pipelines, aborted the next start's lookup). The current periods (the draws' and the prebuild's) are marked
// and handed over, so later captures go to sound ones; arch_write_file drops every period made before the death
// The compiler service (MTLCompilerService) died under the compile: Metal's error then names the XPC connection it lost. Its domain is the GPU family's (AGXMetalG14G on an M2)
// and its code a generic 2, so the text is what tells it apart
static int err_compiler_died(NSError *e) {
