        // once, as before, sent a draw that came while a background worker (pso_bg_look, a hybrid miss's pulling base build) looked up its pulling base to no stand-in and then to a
        // compile of its own base on the submit thread: Ocarina of Time on an iPhone 17, first visits to Hyrule Field and Kakariko, one draw 0.3-1.8 s ("draws that waited: pulling
        // base not made yet"), while every lookup the workers made found its base (upstream edc7eff9c, PR #2770). On NX 18's iPhone one lookup in Ocarina's 4.7 GB bundled
        // archive takes about 50 ms, so that is the longest such a wait lasts
