                   "background with %d compiles still under way", g_pre_prep_idle_ms / 1e3, (bp_now() - t0) / 1e9, later, left - later);
    else if (left > 0) MLOG("pipeline prepare: every shader pair handed out after %.1f s; %d compiles still under way after %.1f s more finish in the background, their files opened at the next start",
