// encodes), the entries the table needed (all, in full encodes), entries drawn from a feedback snapshot, mismatches, moved under a version taken without a look, slot-bound texture /
// sampler bindings of those shaders resolved, versions built and their bytes, epochs by what moved, ticks of the checks
