    // since then would read as 0 there (wrong rendering, or a task shader that hangs as agl's did). So their table words are pointed at a table of the pools as they are now, as at every
    // other commit, whole or segment: cb_commit seals it as it seals them (mtl_sub_commit, sub_cut; the block comment above gmem_slot_note)
    // Its feedback handler only adds the command buffer's GPU interval to the busy time (the power line's GPU ms/s): this command buffer holds the game's work up to the
